Kraken API 5.5.1 compiled with javac --release 11.
These diffs drop the login hook type from GameHooks and HooksLoader.
Login sources and the break-handler package are excluded from compilation in
kraken-api-java11/build.gradle. They stay in the tree.

v3 also removes modules [VJ]Prayer Flicker does not reach. Those deletions are
the file list in NOTICE, not a hunk in this patch. ClickScheduler is one of the
removed classes. While it was shipped, it called Client.getAccountHash() through
reflection so the class file did not name the Jagex interface that declares that
method. That class is not compiled into VJPrayerFlicker-v3.jar.

